#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:62
#: 08aac2a1405b459f80d1fa134a626a40 4114637381244787a75d3f596bc3b548
#: 4eec13e3bc0840528161dccd11655821 700c4efe08124dbdb716d6dc7b86f340
#: 84ae7b86582440578033213824dc8013 bee5fbca7a7d4b8788358ecdfc0e5dba
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:64
#: 2eb89e23a8974a67b2f44d3011988c87 434b04ef46624c9b99a2a5ad3807169d
#: 88a82e5e8a3f4592897a0e1a2dd147f9 9344948fe3934af19e76091b0140e1f6
#: a6c2e487a1b8418b86446b20b8ff8aa3 d6bb3f90c3f34fc4b3f8413a96a5b7b9
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但是，将 DShot 和普通 PWM 混合用于输出受到组限制，即为某组中的一个输出启用 DShot "
"要求该组中的所有输出均配置并用作 DShot 而非 PWM 输出。必须相同的输出组（PWM 速率或 "
"DShot，当配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）为：1/2、3/4、5/6。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:67
#: 6e4688e620bb44d8b8ca1216c570b8c5 76dddd6149e34949a99f6a7c71ddc516
#: 9ad2f4ecdc37475e83fd2b172c4fed9e b626c4af7d074d6089259a29b599fb63
#: dcf94ada43744eebac4aeeb8169b4255 f1956b1964cd4f7e97cc4952c23e2883
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:68
#: 0dd12fade79f4cbd9a8d7f5286f0db7d 2aad8e3307c845fc8e54d53a4daf1565
#: 66d880f3ae994153ac6dbc0a781314c2 9b6ab2224bf740bca0b159b1e4d0b72a
#: b96386ff15ca43368e1f63839ba0c7fe fea06e09b0cb4e059499369dde464b6f
msgid ""
"The F-35 has ability to have the middle rail for M1/M2 to be independent of "
"that of the S1-S6 slots, which are supplied by the internal 5V regulator, or"
" to have it tied to them, via board jumper pads. The WingFC10 is isolated "
"with no pad option. The internal regulators can only supply two or three "
"standard servos (3A). It is generally recommended that servos be powered "
"independent of on-board regulators to avoid noise injection issues. For both"
" boards this means either cutting traces or externally powering the servos."
msgstr ""
"F-35 的 M1/M2 中间电源轨可通过板上跳线焊盘独立于 S1-S6 插槽（由内部 5V 稳压器供电）或与其共用。WingFC10 "
"完全隔离，无焊盘选项。内部稳压器只能为两到三个标准舵机（3A）供电。通常建议舵机独立于板载稳压器供电，以避免噪声注入问题。对于两款飞控板，这意味着需要切断走线或为舵机外部供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:71
#: 03ff22bacd2043d39b79c6c7a42a596c 6e9856ee17224720a894ed3daa01b4a2
#: 74993216e29241e398c28ac5b81db423 76290b18d3f5469daaca1377dce4e037
#: 9d3bb308e0f848ee9cc2e87a100f017e bdadc218213840c0bf49bc97f4409e80
msgid ""
"Both boards have an onboard compass, however, since there is an on-board "
"current sensor, if used, the compass cannot be accurately used and should be"
" disabled in ArduPilot. For plane use, not having a compass is a non-issue, "
"but compass is required for Copter/QuadPlane."
msgstr ""
"两款飞控板均有板载罗盘，但由于有板载电流传感器，如果使用电流传感器，罗盘将无法准确使用，应在 ArduPilot "
"中将其禁用。对于固定翼使用，没有罗盘不是问题，但 Copter/QuadPlane 需要罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:73
#: 4adc996aa5a7458795fe3dc265cdf9e1 9e491a864b12471eaa85e0fe6ca8a5ec
#: d3f6f0121fb84dbbaeff1e9c5a1b089c ded8c88307c74f5a8deb26f8963680f6
#: f3a5c9a52bf8412c851f54e05af1e7a1 fbf043860f7641249b55a3da04227360
msgid ""
"However, an external compass can be connected to the board's I2C1 after a "
"small modification. To enable I2C on the Wing FC10 clone, you need to move "
"from 'PRS' to 'I2C' position (on the bottom side of the board) and use the "
"test pad as shown below. The test pad is I2C1/SDA and the AIR pin is "
"I2C1/SCL after the jumper modification."
msgstr ""
"但是，经过小幅改造后，可以将外部罗盘连接到飞控板的 I2C1。要在 Wing FC10 克隆版上启用 "
"I2C，需要将跳线从「PRS」位置移到「I2C」位置（在飞控板底面），并使用如下所示的测试焊盘。经跳线改造后，测试焊盘为 I2C1/SDA，AIR "
"引脚为 I2C1/SCL。"

