msgid ""
"For the F-35, there are solder pads for the internal I2C bus as shown below."
" An external compass can be attached to these pads."
msgstr "对于 F-35，有用于内部 I2C 总线的焊盘，如下所示。外部罗盘可连接到这些焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:81
#: 09e7b990a38a41c1851b9758c820b7a2 313e8c70216043db959943c41d0c7d56
