msgid ""
"Be sure to disable the internal compass in all cases. Also be careful when "
"connecting to board solder pads since they can be easily torn from the "
"board. Using small wire and securing with some kind of glue after soldering "
"is recommended."
msgstr "务必在所有情况下禁用内部罗盘。连接到飞控板焊盘时要小心，因为它们很容易从板上撕裂。建议使用细导线并在焊接后用某种胶水固定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-furiousfpv-f35.rst:83
