msgid ""
"Either rssi or analog airspeed can be input on the AIR pin if not used for "
"external I2C connections. Either must be first enabled in the params, params"
" refreshed, and then pin \"13\" set for the input, and type set."
msgstr ""
"如果 AIR 引脚未用于外部 I2C 连接，可以在该引脚上输入 RSSI "
"或模拟空速。两者均需先在参数中启用，刷新参数后，再将引脚「13」设置为输入并设置类型。"

